                                                "sense_id": "6ad3a7b3-f2b1-339a-b4f2-759f48c4bb7f",
                                                "text": "Lolicon or Lolicom is a contraction of \"Lolita Complex,\" an unhealthy interest in underage girls exemplified by the Lolita Anime. Its rarer male variant is Shotacon.\nShotacon is a contraction of “Shotaro Complex,” or an unhealthy obsession with little boys. It is said to derive from the boyish good looks of Shotaro Kaneda, the protagonist of GIGANTOR"
